YT6 Clarity Systems Ltd is developing a clarity-layer protocol that addresses one of the most urgent issues in modern AI: multi-turn drift.

## The Problem
AI systems often:
- Change tone
- Change structure
- Change reasoning
- Lose clarity
- Become unpredictable across multi-turn conversations

This breaks trust, reproducibility and safety.

## The YT6 Solution
YT6 provides:
- Multi-turn stability
- Drift-resistance
- Deterministic clarity-layer outputs
- Reproducible reasoning
- Structured operator-style responses

YT6 does not claim to solve all of AI safety.  
It solves a specific, critical part: keeping reasoning stable.

## Why It Matters
AI systems are becoming more powerful and less predictable.  
YT6 provides a clarity-layer foundation that keeps reasoning aligned.

